# Everything the pipeline produces about a book lives in one folder per book.
# One ignored directory rather than a pattern per artifact type: a new kind of
# file used to default to *not* ignored, which is how a copyrighted translation
# and a review file both nearly got committed.
projects/
txt/
temp/
.DS_Store
*.log
*.bak
*.code-workspace
*.old
# Book text and translations live in txt/, which is ignored above — but drafts
# and proofread copies get dropped in the project root too, and those are
# someone else's copyrighted work. Nothing in this repository is a .txt file.
/*.txt
